      "cat-harness:section": "Translating into several locales as a team",
      "prov:value": "Owner, 2026-11-07: \"English lead should document the process and skills\". The section records the steps the team ran across three instances; the harness commands it lists were merged in cat-harness-tools#1598 (`--instance`) and #1595 (segmentMarkdown in po-inject), with translation:glossary:check in flight (#1599, #1601).",
      "cat-harness:refs": [
